==English==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|dilatorie}}, from {{der|en|fro|dilatoire}},<ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref> from {{der|en|la|dīlātōrius||extending or putting off (time)}}, from {{m|la|dīlātor}}, from {{m|la|differō}}. Not etymologically related to {{m|en|delay}}.

====Pronunciation====
