* {{IPA|en|/ˈdɪləˌtɔɹi/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Naomi Persephone Amethyst (NaomiAmethyst)-dilatory.wav|a=US}}

====Adjective====
