# Intentionally [[delay]]ing (someone or something), intended to cause delay, [[gain]] time, or [[adjourn]] decision.
#: ''a '''dilatory''' [[strategy]]''
#* {{RQ:Motley Dutch Republic|passage=Alva, as usual, brought his '''dilatory''' policy to bear upon his adversary with great effect.}}
# [[slow|Slow]] or [[tardy]].

